t;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="0" data-aria-level="2" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW52516736 BCX0"><p class="Paragraph SCXW52516736 BCX0" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" paraid="655244135" paraeid="{22902e0a-1a43-401f-be87-e0adff86da39}{137}">&nbsp; &nbsp;Topped up coolant 15 liters.&nbsp;</p></li><li data-leveltext="?" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335551671&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;?&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="0" data-aria-level="2" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW52516736 BCX0"><p class="Paragraph SCXW52516736 BCX0" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" paraid="1510748398" paraeid="{701bc8e2-a448-4f49-ad24-0efd3a518854}{137}">&nbsp; &nbsp;Perform electrical de-isolation and process de-isolation&nbsp;</p></li><li data-leveltext="?" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335551671&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;?&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="0" data-aria-level="2" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW52516736 BCX0"><p class="Paragraph SCXW52516736 BCX0" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" paraid="1375192925" paraeid="{5335a16c-e297-4c7c-bbe0-b95902003335}{42}">&nbsp; &nbsp;Test run with shared load for 30 minutes&nbsp;</p></li></ul>', NULL, '2023-10-04 18:56:33', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\ZMS.MTN-Tech', NULL, false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
