ation-line: underline;">Action<br></b>Isolate the power supply at ITR.<br>Cleaned and changed the cable lug (fork type) of the terminal.<br>Desolated and function test. (Under monitoring)<br></span><br></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW16018947 BCX0" paraid="1212787926" paraeid="{9787cdb3-70eb-42ad-b083-716a89bb5590}{211}"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><b><u>History(05-Oct-2023)</u></b><br></span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW16018947 BCX0" paraid="1212787926" paraeid="{9787cdb3-70eb-42ad-b083-716a89bb5590}{211}"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">T/S level transmitter LIA-81802A abnormal reading<br></span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW16018947 BCX0" paraid="1212787926" paraeid="{9787cdb3-70eb-42ad-b083-716a89bb5590}{211}"><b><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></u></b></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW16018947 BCX0" paraid="1212787926" paraeid="{9787cdb3-70eb-42ad-b083-716a89bb5590}{211}"><b><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action</u></b></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW16018947 BCX0" paraid="1212787926" paraeid="{9787cdb3-70eb-42ad-b083-716a89bb5590}{211}"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Found water inside and clean water &amp; cable terminals.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li data-leveltext="-" data-font="Arial" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;-&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="59" data-aria-level="1" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16018947 BCX0"><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></div></li><li data-leveltext="-" data-font="Arial" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;-&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="60" data-aria-level="1" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16018947 BCX0"><p class="Paragraph SCXW16018947 BCX0" paraid="544803693" paraeid="{9787cdb3-70eb-42ad-b083-716a89bb5590}{236}"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Retighten cable and secure enclosure from water ingress.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul>', NULL, '2023-10-22 11:12:13', '2023-10-22 11:14:17', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
