d tighten all cable terminations at generator control panel (GCP) and local control panel (LCP).Verified voltage drop at fuel gas shut off valve.&nbsp;<br>Generator test run cannot start.<br>GVP did not open.</p></li></ul><p><u><br></u></p><p><u><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History (10-12-2023)</span></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Swap AFR unit from G-8930 to G-8925 &amp; test run.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><u>Action</u><br>Removed AFR from G-8930 and G-8925.<br>Swap both AFR.<br>G-8925 AFR is at G-8925.<br>The New AFR is at G-8930.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">G-8930 test run.<br>Gas valve fail to open.<br>Exercise the Gas valve with power supply.(24 V)</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Test run. Generator fail to start.</span></p>', NULL, '2023-12-13 14:43:10', '2023-12-15 17:55:08', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
