olor: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><b><u>History</u></b><u><b>&nbsp;(24-Jan-24)</b></u></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Verify G-8010 trip ZBV1.</span></p><p><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Found&nbsp;</b></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">SD oil pressure low alarm.<br>Breaker trip position.</span></p><p><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action&nbsp;</b></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Check the voltage of the battery.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Check the voltage of the lube oil pressure sensor (10.8V).</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">The voltage is not working properly.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Plan to jump dc wire to the com app board next visit.</span></p>', NULL, '2024-02-12 18:51:48', '2024-02-12 21:10:34', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
