ulation Resistance (M-OHM) of Space Heater (Control Panel)<br><br>1YPM For G8920, 60% Completed<br><br><br></span></p><p><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History(15-03-2024)</b></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">12M PM G-8920 Gas Engine Gen Package 1</span></p><p><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action</b></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Measure insulation resistance (IR) of Radiator Fan#1 and Fan#2 Motor winding at 500<br>Measure resistance value (R) of Radiator Fan#1 and Fan#2 motor winding.<br>Measure insulation resistance (IR) of Exhaust Fan#1 and&nbsp;Fan#2 Motor winding at 500V.<br>Measure resistance value (R) of Exhaust Fan#1 and&nbsp;Fan#2 motor winding.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br>1YPM G-8920 30% Completed.</span></p><div><br></div>', NULL, '2024-03-17 16:23:54', '2024-09-05 07:07:00', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Elec-Tec', false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
