ion<br></u></p><p>TS (2) Emergency lighting at water treatment area.</p><p>Replaced new switches, ballast, battery and lightings.<br>Cleaned the lighting area.<br>Function test at emergency status and normal status.<br>These lightings are working properly at every status.</p><p><u><br></u></p><p><u>History(03-Apr-24)</u><br></p><p>Troubleshoot emergency lighting at ZOC water treatment package.<br><u>Action</u><br>TS (2) Emergency lighting at water treatment area.</p><p>Replaced new switches, ballast, battery and lightings.<br>Function test at emergency status and normal status.<br>These lightings are working properly at every status.</p>', NULL, '2024-04-07 17:41:40', '2024-04-19 17:35:47', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Inst-Tec', 'PTTEP\ZOC.Inst-Tec', false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
