s = 80.0 %&nbsp; +/- 1 % )</p><p>- Online sample loop and monitoring reading value with CCR , Found there are reading as normal.</p>', '<p><a href="G:\GBSShare\Department Share\03 Maintenance\032 DBS_MEI\074 E&amp;I Metering &amp; Analyzer Report\04. Analyzer\2AIT-37125 CO2 Analyzer\2024\6MPM 20240527" target="_blank">Picture</a><br></p>', '2024-05-27 16:20:52', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\GBS.EI-Workshop', NULL, false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
  INSERT INTO tags (report_id, equipment_no, technical_id_no, technical_object_description, superior_functional_location, superior_equipment, text, location, children, created_date, updated_date) VALUES (new_report_id, 'GBS-2AIT-37125', 'GBS-2AIT-37125', 'GAS CHROMATOGRAPH AIT', NULL, NULL, 'GAS CHROMATOGRAPH AIT', 'GBS-PP', false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
