eight="20" class="xl72" width="507"><u>AIR SYSTEM</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="18">   <td colspan="2" height="18" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK AIR CYLINDER PRESSURE IS NOT LOWER THAN 2600   PSIG (18 MPA).</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK OVER AND UNDER PRESSURE DEVICES ARE FREE TO   OPERATE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK AUTOMATIC MUSHROOM VENTILATOR IS FREE TO   OPERATE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK CONDITION OF AIR SYSTEM INCLUDING VALVE,   GAUGE AND AIR HOSE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl70" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl72" width="507"><u>SPRAY SYSTEM</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK INTAKE SPRAY SYSTEM IS   CLEAR.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK SPRAY SEA WATER INLET VALVE   HANDLE IS FREE TO OPERATE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK THE GRILL PLATE AT THE SEA   WATER INLET VALVE IS CLEAR AND FIRMLY FIXED.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK SPRAY PUMP DRAIN HOLE IS   CLEAR, DRAIN LINE IS SECURE AND DRAIN VALVE IS OPERATE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK AND LUBRICATE SPRAY PUMP.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">ENSURE THE PUMP MOUNTING BOLTS   ARE SECURE AND PUMP IS CORRECTLY ALIGNED</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK THE TOOTH BELT AND BELT   TENSION.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK THE JUBILLE CLIPS ON THE   HOSE THAT ARE TIGHTEN BUT NOT SEIZED.&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK RUBBER HOSE ON THE SEA   WATER INLET.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK CONDITION OF DELIVERY HOSE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl74" align="left" width="507">CHECK ALL OF PIPINGS AND FITTINGS   FOR LEAKING.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl76" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl72" width="507"><u>HOOK RELEASE GEAR</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">VISUAL INSPECT FOR ANY DAMAGING AND CORROSION.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CLEAN AND GREASE/OIL ALL OF MOVING PARTS,   EXPECIALLY ALL BEARINGS.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK ALL OF LINKS ARE CORRECTLY ENGAGED AND THE   CAM PIN IS IN THE RIGHT POSITION ON THE HOOK TAIL.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK SAFETY PIN IS FITTED AND RELEASE LEVER IS   FULLY LOCKED POSITION.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK HYDROSTATIC LOCK LEVER IS IN THE GREEN   POSITION.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK CABLE ARE FREE AND NOT DAMAGE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">TEST HOOK RELEASE MECHANISM THAT CAN BE OPERATED   CORRECTLY.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl70" width="507">&nbsp;LUBRICATED PENDENT LINE 6EA.<br><br></td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl72" width="507"><u>ENGINE</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK FUEL TANK LEVEL.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK STARTING SYSTEM.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK ENGINE ANG GEARBOX LUBE OIL LEVEL.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK COOLANT LEVEL AND DENSITY.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK FUEL, LUBE OIL AND COOLANT SYSTEM FOR   LEAKING.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK ENGINE BELT TENSION.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl68" width="507">START AND RUN ENGINE IN NEUTRAL APPROX. 5 MINUTE   AND ALL OPERATING CONDITIONS.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl68" width="507">ENSURE WATER TRAP IN THE SPARK ARRESTOR IS   DRAINED.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK SPARK ARRESTOR ELEMENT.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK PIPE AND FITTING FOR LEAKING.<br>LUBE AND EXERCISE LINKAGE OF THORTTLE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl72" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl72" width="507"><u>SPRING STARTING SYSTEM</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK ALL MOUNTS, SOCKET AND RATCHET ARE IN THE   GOOD CONDITION.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK THE OPERATING SYSTEM, CORRECT IF REQUIRED.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl70" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="21">   <td colspan="2" height="21" class="xl72" width="507"><u>EXHAUST SYSTEM</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK FLAPPER ON EXHAUST OUTLET IS FREE TO   OPEN/CLOSE AND IS KEPT CLOSE WHEN ENGINE IS STOPPED.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="18">   <td colspan="2" height="18" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK ALL EXHAUST PIPE/ FITTING SYSTEM TO ENSURE   NO FUMES LEAKE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="18">   <td colspan="2" height="18" class="xl78" width="507">CHECK SEAL AROUND EXHAUST OUTLET THROUGH CANOPY IS   NOT DAMAGED.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl80" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl72" width="507"><u>ELECTRICAL AND LIGHTING SYSTEMS</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="18">   <td colspan="2" height="18" class="xl82" width="507">CHECK BATTERY CHARGING CONECTOR IS FIRMLY   CONNECTED.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="18">   <td colspan="2" height="18" class="xl82" width="507">VISUAL CHECK STATUS OF BATTERY CHARGER IS   AVAILABLE.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl82" width="507">CHECK LIGHTING INSIDE AND OUTSIDE. <i style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">As found position light and compass light life boat No.1 not work.</i> Information EMI already</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl70" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl72" width="507"><u>BILGE PUMP</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK PUMP IS OPERATING CORRECTLY.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK ALL HOSES AND CLIPS FOR TIGHTENING AND   DAMAGING.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK THE SUCTION POINT, MAIN BILGE AND ENGINE   COMPARTMENT ARE CLEAR, CLEAN, DRY AND FREE FROM DEBRIS.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl84" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl72" width="507"><u>HATCHES</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK HATCHES AND DOORS IS OPERATED FREELY.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK HATCHES AND DOORS FOR DAMAGING.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl70" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl72" width="507">LAUNCH AND RECOVERY SYSTEM</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">VISUAL INSPECT OF OPERATION READINESS.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK LEAKAGE AND MAINTAIN LEVEL OF ALL LUBE OIL   BATH FOR LUBRICATING WINCH OR OTHER REDUCTION GEARS.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK AND GREASE ALL PIVOTS, BEARING AND OTHER   GREASE POINTS.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="33">   <td colspan="2" height="33" class="xl68" width="507">CARRY OUT FUNCTIONAL TEST OF MANUAL WINCH BRAKE   BOTH DIRECTION AND REMOTE CONTROL.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK ALL SAFETY DEVICES AND SWITCH GEAR FOR   PROPER WORKING.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="32">   <td colspan="2" height="32" class="xl68" width="507">CHECK AND RE-ADJUST IF NECESSARY THE WINCH MANUAL   BRAKE AS PER SPECIFIC MBA, BCA OF EQUIVALENT LEAFLET.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl70" width="507">FAST RESCUE CRAFT&nbsp; WINCH POWER PACK:   CHECK HYDRAULIC TANK LEVEL&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl70" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl72" width="507">&nbsp;<u>DAVIT   STRUCTURE</u></td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl68" width="507">LUBRICATE ALL ROLLER WHEELS OR PIVOTS.</td>  </tr>  <tr height="20">   <td colspan="2" height="20" class="xl86" width="507">&nbsp;</td>  </tr></tbody></table>', NULL, '2024-05-29 16:02:00', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\DirekT', NULL, false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
