ta/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif" alt="*">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To install new check   valve to discharge line and check direction flow of check valve.</p>   <p align="left"><img width="17" height="17" src="file:///C:/Users/GBS~1.MEC/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif" alt="*">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To removed ARV to repair   (Fabricated pin and assembly it) and install it.</p>   <p align="left"><img width="17" height="17" src="file:///C:/Users/GBS~1.MEC/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif" alt="*">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To test check valve   passing and leak. (Not found passing and leak)</p>   <p align="left">&nbsp;</p>   </td>  </tr> </tbody></table>', NULL, '2024-06-05 16:15:38', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\GBS.Mechanic-WorkS', NULL, false) RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
