kets. ( wrench 7/8”)</p>   <p><b><u>Fuel   system.</u></b></p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Checked for any leak no found leak.</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Drained sediment and water trap from   fuel tank.</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cleaned up fuel pre-filter   (strainer)(wrench15/16”)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   </p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Replaced fuel filter quantity 2   pieces.(CAT,IR-0749) (wrench 11/16”)</p>   <p><b><u>Air   induction system</u></b>.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Changed Air intake filter.</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inspected air inlet system for any leaks   no found leak.</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Visual checked and inspected the   Turbocharger as found shaft impeller clearance out of   tolerance.</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Plan to replace with new Turbocharger in next window.</p>   <p><b><u>Pump   and gearbox</u></b><u>. </u></p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inspected coupling and lubricate   universal joint with grease.</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Checked all coupling bolt tightness (Apply   torque @177 Ft-lb or 240 Nm). </p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (wrench11/16”, ¾”, 15/16”)</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Checked coupling bolt between gearbox   and pump tightness ( Apply torque @90 Nm)</p>   <p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Changed gear oil with PTT Gear oil   EP-320 quantity 38 liters. (wrench 1 1/16”) </p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   </td>  </tr> </tbody></table>', '<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" width="671" style="width: 503.25pt; margin-left: 6.75pt; margin-right: 6.75pt;">
